<title>SWEDEN: Gambro wins Baxter patent lawsuit.</title>
<headline>Gambro wins Baxter patent lawsuit.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish medical technology group Gambro has won a patent lawsuit against Baxter International Inc concerning dialysis equipment, Gambro owner Incentive AB said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
